<doc id="53479" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=53479" title="Kebon Botani Auburn">
Kebon Botani Auburn

Kebon Botani Auburn iku sawijining &lt;a href="kebon%20botani"&gt;kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; sing ana ing kutha &lt;a href="Auburn%2C%20New%20South%20Wales"&gt;Auburn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20South%20Wales"&gt;New South Wales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. Kebon iki diwiwiti taun &lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt; lan jembaré 9,7 hektar.
Ing njero kebon iki ana rong &lt;a href="tlaga"&gt;tlaga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="grojogan"&gt;grojogan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kreteg"&gt;kreteg&lt;/a&gt; sing diilèni banyu saka Kali “Duck River”. Saiki &lt;a href="kebon%20botani"&gt;kebon botani&lt;/a&gt; iki dikelola déning &lt;a href="pamar%C3%A9ntah"&gt;pamaréntah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Auburn%2C%20New%20South%20Wales"&gt;Auburn&lt;/a&gt;, sapa waé bisa lumebu nanging musti mbayar sethithik. Ing njero kebon iki, kuciwané ora ana ruangan pameran njeron ruang.
