<doc id="54033" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=54033" title="Cotroceni">
Cotroceni

Cotroceni iku distrik sing ana ing arah &lt;a href="Kulon"&gt;Kulon&lt;/a&gt; saka kutha &lt;a href="Bukares"&gt;Bukares&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rumania"&gt;Rumania&lt;/a&gt;, dumunung ing bukit Cotroceni, &lt;a href="Sektor%205%20%28Bukares%29"&gt;Sektor 5&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bukares"&gt;Bukares&lt;/a&gt;.
Perbukitan iku ditutupi déning &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Alas%20Vl%C4%83sia"&gt;Vlăsia&lt;/a&gt;, sing sajatiné dadi laladan saka &lt;a href="Bukares"&gt;Bukares&lt;/a&gt; saiki. Ning kéné, ing taun &lt;a href="1679"&gt;1679&lt;/a&gt; naté dibangun sawijining biara déning &lt;a href="%C5%9Eerban%20Cantacuzino"&gt;Şerban Cantacuzino&lt;/a&gt;, sing wusanané diowahi dadi pura ing taun &lt;a href="1888"&gt;1888&lt;/a&gt;.
Tumuju tlatah iki bisa numpak sepur ngisor lemah, utawa sing kondhang kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Bucharest%20Metro"&gt;Metro&lt;/a&gt; lan mudhun ing &lt;a href="stasiun"&gt;stasiun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Eroilor%20metro%20station"&gt;Eroilor&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Politehnica%20metro%20station"&gt;Politehnica&lt;/a&gt;.
