<doc id="54049" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=54049" title="Sauropsida">
Sauropsida

Sauropsida (rai kadhal) iku golongan &lt;a href="amniota"&gt;amniota&lt;/a&gt; kang kalebu (antarané) kabèh &lt;a href="reptilia"&gt;reptilia&lt;/a&gt; kang isih ana, &lt;a href="dinosaurus"&gt;dinosaurus&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="manuk"&gt;manuk&lt;/a&gt;. Sauropsida bisa dibédakaké karo &lt;a href="Theropsida"&gt;Theropsida&lt;/a&gt; ("beast faces"), kang luwih umum diarani &lt;a href="Synapsida"&gt;Synapsida&lt;/a&gt;, kang kalebu &lt;a href="mamalia"&gt;mamalia&lt;/a&gt;.
