Dhaptar pulo paling jaba ing Indonésia

Kaca iki ngamot pratélan 92 Pulo paling jaba &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; miturut Peraturan Présidhèn Nomer 78 Taun 2005. Peraturan Présidhèn mau ditpakasmani déning Présidhèn &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Républik Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Susilo%20Bambang%20Yudhoyono"&gt;Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono&lt;/a&gt; tanggal &lt;a href="29%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;29 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;. Gunggung 92 pulo ing wewengkon Indonésia wewatesan langsung karo nagara tangga antarané: &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt; (22), &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; (2), &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt; (11), &lt;a href="Palau"&gt;Palau&lt;/a&gt; (7), &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; (23), &lt;a href="Timor%20Leste"&gt;Timor Leste&lt;/a&gt; (10), &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; (13), &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt; (4) lan &lt;a href="Papua%20Nugini"&gt;Papua Nugini&lt;/a&gt; (1). Ka-92 Pulo mau kasebar ing 18 provinsi Indonésia ya iku &lt;a href="Nanggroe%20Ac%C3%A8h%20Darussalam"&gt;Nanggroe Acèh Darussalam&lt;/a&gt; (6), &lt;a href="Sumatra%20Lor"&gt;Sumatra Lor&lt;/a&gt; (3), &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Riau"&gt;Kapuloan Riau&lt;/a&gt; (20), &lt;a href="Sumatra%20Kulon"&gt;Sumatra Kulon&lt;/a&gt; (2), &lt;a href="Bengkulu"&gt;Bengkulu&lt;/a&gt; (2), &lt;a href="Lampung"&gt;Lampung&lt;/a&gt; (1), &lt;a href="Banten"&gt;Banten&lt;/a&gt; (1), &lt;a href="Jawa%20Kulon"&gt;Jawa Kulon&lt;/a&gt; (1), &lt;a href="Jawa%20Tengah"&gt;Jawa Tengah&lt;/a&gt; (1), &lt;a href="Jawa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Jawa Wétan&lt;/a&gt; (3), &lt;a href="Nusa%20Tenggara%20Kulon"&gt;Nusa Tenggara Kulon&lt;/a&gt; (1), &lt;a href="Nusa%20Tenggara%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Nusa Tenggara Wétan&lt;/a&gt; (5), &lt;a href="Kalimantan%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Kalimantan Wétan&lt;/a&gt; (4), &lt;a href="Sulawesi%20Tengah"&gt;Sulawesi Tengah&lt;/a&gt; (3), &lt;a href="Sulawesi%20Lor"&gt;Sulawesi Lor&lt;/a&gt; (11), &lt;a href="Maluku%20Lor"&gt;Maluku Lor&lt;/a&gt; (1), &lt;a href="Maluku"&gt;Maluku&lt;/a&gt; (18), &lt;a href="Papua"&gt;Papua&lt;/a&gt; (6) lan &lt;a href="Papua%20Kulon"&gt;Papua Kulon&lt;/a&gt; (3).
